# M17 armour cost (docs/CLIENT_RENDERING.md §18): run with --vsync off --debug-ghosts 20 at 1920x1080. The 20 synthetic
# remote players are measured without armour, then dressed (`scene dressremotes`: a full set each, lines and tiers
# mixed) together with the local character; `scene log` writes "world: perf ..." with draw calls, triangles and the
# number of armour pieces drawn.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m17_perf
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.name
text Sayici
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle 1800
waitfor world+remotes20 900
scene camera behind 25 9
wait 1500
scene log
screenshot perf_20_plain.png
scene dressremotes
scene wear 130 131 132 133 134
wait 1500
scene log
screenshot perf_20_armoured.png
quit
